[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5215070502","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122180#issuecomment-5215070502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122180","id":5215070502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNtepJg","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-07T09:04:10Z","updated_at":"2026-08-07T09:04:10Z","body":"Does this handle both binary scene and text scene?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5215070502/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5216878273","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122180#issuecomment-5216878273","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122180","id":5216878273,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNvM-wQ","user":{"login":"leandro-benedet-garcia","id":291051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTA1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/291051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia","html_url":"https://github.com/leandro-benedet-garcia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leandro-benedet-garcia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-07T12:09:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T14:48:21Z","body":"> Does this handle both binary scene and text scene?\r\n\r\nEDIT after investigating things further:\r\nYou already can do all of this in stable releases of Godot for binary files.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool\r\nclass_name CustomScene\r\nextends PackedScene\r\n\r\n@export_storage var test: StringName\r\n```\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\n@export_tool_button(\"save_new\") var store_new_action = store_new\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n    store_new()\r\n\r\nfunc store_new() -> void:\r\n    const SCENE_BINARY = \"res://test_custom_scenes.res\"\r\n    var scene := CustomScene.new()\r\n    scene.pack(Node3D.new())\r\n    scene.test = \"OBVIOUS VALUE\"\r\n    ResourceSaver.save(scene, SCENE_BINARY)\r\n    \r\n    var loaded_scene: CustomScene = ResourceLoader.load(SCENE_BINARY)\r\n    print(loaded_scene.test)\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5216878273/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5705161713","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122180#issuecomment-5705161713","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122180","id":5705161713,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVA3b8Q","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-16T21:58:08Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T21:58:08Z","body":"It was brought up in Godot Engine rocket chat that we don’t know what problem this is solving other than it was noticed failing.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5705161713/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5907080461","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine